# acr_values options:
# - "" (blank): no forced MFA; legacy provider choice unchanged (e.g., GCKey + Interac)
# - "gckey": GCKey only
# - "MFA": force MFA prompt
# - "gckey,MFA": GCKey only + force MFA prompt
# RP redirect URI options:
# - rp_redirect_uri_en: used for English sessions
# - rp_redirect_uri_fr: used for French sessions
# - rp_redirect_uri: optional fallback if a language-specific URL is not configured
